scount":"9.5折","sold":"半年售 7.1万+"},{"id":"1195845503","name":"200元代金券","price":191,"value":200,"discount":"9.6折","sold":"半年售 2.6万+"},{"id":"1197754718","name":"300元代金券","price":289,"value":300,"discount":"9.7折","sold":"半年售 1.4万+"}],"reviews":[{"id":"3507801425","user":"花**","time":"7小时前","star":5,"text":"很好吃，宽粉绝绝子。「酸菜包子」每次打包一盒子回家家","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3507221475","user":"S**","time":"21小时前","star":5,"text":"东北铁锅炖太好吃了，正宗东北大铁锅炖上满满一大锅，咕嘟咕嘟冒着热气，香气一下子就散开了，闻着就让人胃口大开。冬天和三五好友围坐在灶台边一起吃，锅里热气氤氲，暖乎乎的，从身子暖到心里。店里的人待客也很热情，说话爽朗，氛围特别热闹。大家一边等着锅炖好，一边闲聊，夹上炖得软烂入味的菜，一口下去幸福感满满，寒冬里来上这么一餐，实在太惬意了。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/zicQvJxeBu2QMdEcYLVu1MnmZWjk-JSdILq2jPYSOWMZjY94xsks_ye3tS30UwCWElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3507062427","user":"子**","time":"22小时前","star":5,"text":"打卡玺炖东北炖，点了鹅掌罗氏虾锅，太惊喜！罗氏虾虾肉紧实Q弹，虾黄满满，一口下去超满足，鹅掌炖得软糯入味，轻轻一抿就脱骨。锅边贴着金黄玉米饼，底部吸满浓郁汤汁，香到停不下来。\n\n必须夸夸两位服务员！熊二的翻炒手艺超厉害，把控火候刚刚好；迷糊小姐姐特别热情，全程贴心帮忙添汤、分菜，有需求响应很快，每一位服务人员都是态度到位。还有特色冻梨，冰冰凉凉清甜解腻，刚好中和炖菜的厚重。一锅热气腾腾，氛围感拉满，分量扎实，朋友聚餐首选，下次还想来试试别的锅！","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/FsV0AnabA8d96Zj8S_eAgzfl25IaocokdpuYemUMnc9G7IRfHv3usi9IqNBdPmRFElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/dHWcGnhrkqJmMxi4K5TakxzOXcXAMYM24_0TK2K8JsbM4GPerVhGmjl3PF7HmfAfElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3506772075","user":"黑**","time":"昨天","star":5,"text":"哎呀妈太好吃了！怎么这么好吃！美食治愈人心！超级美味的东北铁锅炖！服务也特别贴心，温暖的东北人，好到小朋友催我写好评的程度。\n\n有小朋友我们选择了不辣的排骨锅，加上豆角宽粉「土豆」，一出锅简直了太香了，都炖到刚刚好的程度无敌美味。熏鹅也好好吃，还贴心地送了冻梨和大白梨饮料，东北人的热情不是盖的。一家人围绕在大铁锅旁边捞吃的、很温暖很治愈。尤其是冬天，很冷的时候从外面进来温温暖暖地吃一锅热乎乎的菜、贴饼子，简直是人间幸事～\n\n服务特别特别好特别贴心周到，从一开始贴心提醒小心烫到，一直换盘子，清垃圾，真的很好很好，每个服务员都特别好亲切可爱。来吃不会失望的！很治愈暖心，下次还来～","likes":1,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/p5uGanGAObtBmh-a1iINg4em55Kduq6LyjYRmMwdF87oEswSqAaRQBHReVGBiyvIElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3505982556","user":"对**","time":"昨天","star":5,"text":"口味：佳","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/aa3101b88d654df8070db43476d7e8d7532235.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3505174112","user":"匿**","time":"2天前","star":4.5,"text":"吃了好多顿了，很好吃。开在张江，下班去吃很方便，量很大，麻辣的有点太太太太太太辣了，不过确实吃的很过瘾，\n性价比：非常高\n口味：「黑龙江细粉」\n口味：「玉米饼」\n口味：「铁锅炖大鹅」\n👫🏻排队：不怎么排队。\n都很不错，推荐推荐","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3504079281","user":"f**","time":"2天前","star":4.5,"text":"好多分店，生意也挺好的，就是人少吃不掉","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3503631878","user":"一**","time":"2天前","star":4.5,"text":"第一次吃东北铁锅炖\n感觉很不错。 服务人员很热情，服务周到贴心。\n周中晚上人相对少一些，适合和朋友来吃，一边吃一边聊天。\n而且分量感觉很大。素菜分量超出想象，点多了…\n总体来说推荐。鹿茸菇很好吃。「铁锅炖大鹅」「玉米饼」「东北老豆腐」「东北娃娃菜」「黑龙江宽粉」「辽宁酸菜」「丝瓜尖拌豆皮」\n「鹿茸菌」","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/VkRrgwId77RX_29oDoPoTQjhaWh_MQ81u3f7-tHTMpObjxVGI9_rYy-Buj_tRvyVElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3499835507","user":"S**","time":"5天前","star":4,"text":"口味：「玉米饼」「玉米饼」好吃 更易还可以吧\n环境：不错 有包房 很方便\n服务：还行吧\n👫🏻排队：不需要排队\n🅿️停车：不太好停车\n「东北大拉皮」拉皮好吃 分了两小分 方便\n「锅包肉」感觉加了橙汁 很薄\n「炸蘑菇」这个比较失望 不热 \n「牛筋牛腩锅」牛腩好吃 筋头巴脑 不错\n「东北老豆腐」好吃😋","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/rqllAfQfzZ1swdc9zDv1TkwmBpIBKDzMjqT9QBna7DapSCT9e8D0-TZ2OCWv0MvOElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/lY1rlVxLoDtqEtTj7uF8nsd5G3t73wSjx361gPxH7FL5pDDfqCmlHXTuwAGlOCD0Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/4xmxhFgGZgL7WoyyYrmhq2t34kPABEf2qMAXaCezn8ykCzLUM3mZiAryf-deVNVeElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/T4_6oKecwO_cCv_XpqCdbrbjrAWIpniTk7I7kmSVzFyr8Y0PBhN6zWOUq92oiJ18Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3499613995","user":"匿**","time":"5天前","star":3.5,"text":"「炸鲜蘑」味道一般，面粉裹的过重，蘑菇味儿非常淡\n「东北大拉皮」好吃\n「爽口拍黄瓜」菜里有异物，给换了盘新的，额外又送了个菜，算是比较好的解决了\n包房不能用团购。铁锅炖味道不错。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/mFYtKPwNweFpcpYK8jpdPyckGX4otDUUO0zozvoq9d8TyeYqPq4JtKZQGGEtmtU4Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/BsN6ROjERJv-1g-Kop-dZ91hyHdYKusGG44i63qqySleYxwq4ZOQ2FpFZ-JTb8PmElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3498131215","user":"地**","time":"6天前","star":5,"text":"服务：服务实在是太好了，又热情又贴心，挑不出一点毛病。过生日还送了一碗长寿面。\n口味：地道东北铁锅炖，选的是番茄牛腩锅，牛肉很，土豆和胡萝卜需要多炖一会儿，还可以叫服务员多加几次原汤，炖烂了才好吃。收藏打卡送黄桃，有点甜","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/7pmr1A4i-XnC0AhwuBKQ3xtUvvr3FlEnQsR1xIJbIQGaWIodP8iSgL0oSeRoXGkUElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/jjHlMWKD7IcTvMMT_kXYPgzroyO6GFpYUTPI_It_6fnSRa1ba_ERAJOCtqjUWvjLElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3497199621","user":"在**","time":"6天前","star":3.5,"text":"口味：「铁锅炖排骨」偏咸\n性价比：一般\n服务：很好\n环境：还可以\n👫🏻排队：不排队","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/eQAO_MCqn3ygEkpiYhyKDSrZ0Ou2GlItSZzPRe59mTpjFQ4I3TXUHw47-Hm63Le5Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3495569163","user":"闲**","time":"10月9日","star":4,"text":"量很大 我们三个女生没吃完 \n天天抓大鹅，总算吃了顿「铁锅炖大鹅」\n大鹅有点老 一个在矫正牙齿，一个刚拔好牙，一个小鸡胃\n不知道哪来的勇气跑来吃这玩意儿…当时脑袋抽抽了\n\n咬不动，费了九牛二虎之力 用没有拔牙的一边嚼吧嚼吧两下生吞了。\n就饼饼 咱们还不够分 泡汤入味软了呀呀呀","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/coverpic/e59f3205d4ba3e4ffc1854d50bd3707d217044.jpg%40400w_400h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3493992446","user":"吧**","time":"10月8日","star":4.5,"text":"玺炖铁锅炖排骨超惊艳！排骨炖得软烂脱骨，酱香浓郁超入味，配菜吸满汤汁，暖乎乎一锅吃着超满足，值得N刷！","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/q_KJCguLADfd03_TEb-LKcPi7fAIXWJhTsvvv5vNMatX6887YM8jDop0yznbltHYElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/wMup3UxvGZmkbJgIcNsvRoU9u3LHl0KUMk7lewWhx53LF63Iiymxfmi8Ymq70ojjElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3492645672","user":"匿**","time":"10月8日","star":4.5,"text":"「锅包肉」很不错，脆脆的，配上酱汁一点不腻","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3490027288","user":"星**","time":"10月6日","star":4.5,"text":"在上海很火的东北菜代表-铁锅炖大行其道，这次来张江首店首次品尝。\n口味：不需过多烹饪，食材地道原生态，炖出来的浓香和家乡味，软烂的大块牛腩配以西红柿的清炖慢煮，田间地头的好味道扑鼻而来。\n环境：团花锦簇的东北风卡座，恍然置身于东北农家的热炕头 ，温馨而热烈。\n服务：服务热情，有求必应，标准化作业一丝不苟。\n性价比：一改东北菜粗放经营的刻板印象，让你体验一把精致而浓烈的东北风情。","likes":1,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/XSV4TmNo1_DNLI5teRfUGKmnQdUs7JrMBAqLlOo5T684vgww1ZcZZ_LC0b5tTBBwElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/K-ddAuBR5FJAYDCNuS6Rft74BzjmnR_yA1KC7BIUaQmHivF9_JotymLFMkuRP8SbElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/TRklE_h9uAjJZx4RyY1Xa5fhMDskm_q2so5LOPkUq3RmgkF2GqHl39a3VFFh7YzuElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/VVFScd4M9mPuJZGIxRwncBvEQ88qGhsotINTlwIGvx3ZIauNcXHGpvPygiQQZN4cElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3487085624","user":"匿**","time":"10月5日","star":5,"text":"国庆人少，但是今天服务质量依旧很高，菜品也很出色很好吃，棒！","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3486381067","user":"匿**","time":"10月4日","star":3.5,"text":"口味：其实味道比较中规中矩的，没有特别的惊艳，冻梨真冰啊，不算特别甜\n环境：环境还可以，在张江这边商场，就是停车是比较拥挤的，不是特别方便\n性价比：性价比一般吧，套餐上来的时候还怕不太够，又加了几个菜","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3485380460","user":"溫**","time":"10月4日","star":5,"text":"这家铁锅炖大鹅真的绝了！掀开锅盖那瞬间，热气糊了我一脸眼镜，但香味直接往鼻子里钻，挡都挡不住。鹅肉炖得贼烂乎，筷子一夹就脱骨，皮那块儿糯叽叽的，吸饱了汤汁，咬下去直接在嘴里化开。贴饼子必须夸，底下那层焦脆焦脆的，蘸着锅底的酱汁，我一个人能干仨。就是吃到后面有点咸，猛灌了两杯酸梅汤。服务员大姐特实在，看我们四个人点大锅还劝“够吃了够吃了”，果然没吃完打包了一大盒。冬天就得这么吃，吃完浑身冒汗，出门冷风一吹都不带哆嗦的。下次得带我爸来，他就好这口。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3484042387","user":"i**","time":"10月3日","star":4.5,"text":"自从在长白山吃过「铁锅炖大鹅」后，这印象是好的不的了.\n在比斯特逛完开了20分钟到达这家，味道一如既往的好，团购的4-6人套餐里面的鹅肉5个人吃不完，两斤的鹅肉还是挺多的.\n这个商场停车如果吃到商场打烊的话，建议停路边，吃到十点半出来下不了车库，只能坐货梯到一楼从入库的地方走到车库里面拿车，有点折腾.","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3483577793","user":"w**","time":"10月3日","star":5,"text":"去玺炖中国铁锅炖张江首店体验超棒！菜品口味地道，铁锅炖鲜香入味，分量足。服务态度热情周到，环境温馨舒适，空间布置有特色。性价比很高，值得推荐来尝尝哦！","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3483146719","user":"J**","time":"10月3日","star":5,"text":"玺炖是张江地区不错的东北铁锅炖，节前和同事一起来吃个午餐。\n口味：点的特色荔枝排骨铁锅炖。排骨非常入味，还会淡淡的荔枝味，锅边的玉米饼是灵魂，蘸着汤吃太很香。另外点的锅包肉酸甜适口，外皮酥脆。不输沈阳当地口味。分量很实在，我们三个人完全够吃。\n服务：我们来的早，服务员很热情，响应及时，上菜节奏刚好。","likes":1,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Y9B8YgyKcFeShvJNyXZfdKYLp6Jk9bVSdbWCzLcH4LUnMTSshExi2dEV03OUh4_hElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/mZKAbLSDy4cLpYpKdFM5kat6XA1Kye_juEwndsGecG-GzHlAt4myOGuc4dOj6eEQElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/09rr1ffSSe3m2ky3NOKEdpV5LHPvmWg0Gau_mBFsTvx0QeSFD46HBOzZzVqOK5UKElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/oG9HIyBqBcyNhfXz6FU5Z6ld2HUfyBY0rl17H27YY8UwJ7jnlS9-kQ_8rSzMCyoAElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3482882443","user":"v**","time":"10月3日","star":5,"text":"🔥玺炖铁锅炖氛围感十足，铁锅排骨炖得软烂入味，肉香浓郁。玉米贴饼一半焦脆一半软糯，蘸汤汁超香。锅包肉酸甜酥脆，分量实在，服务热情，适合家庭或者朋友小聚热热闹闹很合适。","likes":0,"images":["https://img.meituan.net/ugcpic/3aa8b5348a62b5b45259f2c4c8280da31208860.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3482665919","user":"随**","time":"10月3日","star":4.5,"text":"口味：主要是铁锅炖，其他的热菜没几道可选的。东北拉皮和「家常凉菜」以及红肠，都是两份上的。\n环境：正常馆子，在一个小型商场的二楼，因为不靠地铁，主要都是附近居民和工作的\n服务：挺好的呢，但和南京东路店比起来，有距离。\n性价比：还行。\n👫🏻排队：周二午市，坐了五成。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3478097178","user":"木**","time":"10月1日","star":4.5,"text":"荔枝排骨，先说结论，总体还是值得来尝试一下。朋友想吃东北铁锅炖，来这里点了三人餐，基本上两个人吃正好，排骨还可以，荔枝也还不错。服务员服务很到位，操作规程也很正规，整体差强人意，下次想吃了还是可以来的。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3470303488","user":"爱**","time":"9月27日","star":5,"text":"开在公司附近，一到中午饭点儿人就超多，过了时间就没那么多人了。\n电梯上去就在电梯口，很好找。不要坐直达梯，又小又慢，人还贼多经常上不去，扶梯就很快\n「东北宽粉」必点\n「东北大拉皮」可以不辣\n「锅包肉」酸甜口\n「东北豆角干」必点","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/WqCtVAuVeWojoJ7OVzTJo_ThqyNZj8GradcY1b1mwhGoLlWc6d3BlcCSEB56vVIhElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/f_vnCOayoBmS5KuVWKTKNfXh6gDJYzUsZTwhxQQzdymxFTxL3C7FrZIUYhTCYmg5Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/YH1-FzT9akNnCCZfxr6yweKDvgC_U92tTIB8ECOTX3i2zp_TX8hWRrt0F6U6HSGzElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/bPdN0lnvJfUHlz3tj37UHUMp6lGq_D2bPC4YZEb6kxT5pDDfqCmlHXTuwAGlOCD0Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3469741639","user":"1**","time":"9月27日","star":5,"text":"这家店环境挺舒服